  {
    bgm: '',
    end_script: 'let name = "normal:debt_collector"\n\n// 【联系人接入】\n// 将花都旧债收债人加入手机联系人，并压低初始好感。\ncontact_add(name)\ncontact_set_favor(name, 10)\n\n// 【旧债初始化】\n// 确认花都旧债进入追讨线，后续连续手机对话会写入预约状态。\n${player.debt_huadu_active} = true\n${player.debt_huadu_amount} = 100000\n${player.debt_huadu_cleared} = false\n${player.debt_huadu_msg_sent} = true\n\n// 【剧情手机对话】\n// 启动强连续的收债手机对白，期间锁定普通闲聊和动作。\ncontact_start_conversation("huadu_debt_contact")',
    id: 'shouzhai-start',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: '',
    object_keys: [
      'normal:debt_collector',
    ],
    presentation: {
      type: 'silent',
    },
    title: '收债人上门事件-开始',
    trigger_expr: '${system.now_day} >= 1 && ${system.now_hour} >= 9 && ${system.now_hour} <= 18 && !${player.debt_huadu_msg_sent} && !${player.debt_huadu_cleared}',
    trigger_mode: 'condition',
  },
  {
    bgm: '',
    end_script: '// 【花都旧债清账】\n// 收债人在临河汽车站当面收账。余额足够则扣除旧债并结清；余额不足则记录升级压力。\nlet debt = ${player.debt_huadu_amount}\nif (debt <= 0) {\n  debt = 100000\n}\n\nif (${player.money} >= debt) {\n  ${player.money} -= debt\n  ${player.debt_huadu_amount} = 0\n  ${player.debt_huadu_active} = false\n  ${player.debt_huadu_cleared} = true\n  ${player.debt_huadu_linh_appointment} = false\n  ${player.debt_huadu_last_pressure} = 0\n  contact_add_favor("normal:debt_collector", 5)\n  contact_send_from("normal:debt_collector", "账清了。以后花都那边没人再拿这事烦你。")\n} else {\n  ${player.debt_huadu_active} = true\n  ${player.debt_huadu_cleared} = false\n  ${player.debt_huadu_last_pressure} = 4\n  contact_add_favor("normal:debt_collector", -8)\n  contact_send_from("normal:debt_collector", "你说当面清账，结果钱不够。下一次就不是这么好说话了。")\n}',
    id: 'debt_collector_arrives_linh_1d',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'qichezhan_lvl1',
    object_keys: [
      'normal:debt_collector',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '临河汽车站门口，彪哥拖着一个旧皮包下了车。他看见你，没寒暄，只把手机上的借条截图亮到你眼前。',
          speaker_key: 'normal:debt_collector',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '人我来了，账也带来了。十万，一分不少，今天在这儿说清楚。',
          speaker_key: 'normal:debt_collector',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '我既然让你来临河，就没打算躲。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '彪哥到临河收账',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    bgm: '',
    end_script: '',
    id: 'recruit_zhuli_application',
    init_script: '// 规则目的：在招聘发布后的第二天收到助理的应聘消息，只负责把“出现候选人”这一步明确落地，不直接写死录用。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_posted} 确认招聘已发布；${player.team_recruit_stage} 判断当前流程是否已进入候选阶段；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于防止重复收取同一份首轮应聘。\n// 计算规则：该事件仅由上游招聘发布节点以 delay_days=1 调度；只有在已发布招聘且尚未收到过该候选人消息时，才推进到“已收到应聘”。\n// 写回变量：把阶段推进到 2，并记录助理已进入招聘流程，同时开放后续跟进入口。\nif (${player.team_recruit_posted} && !${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  ${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\n  ${player.team_zhuli_application_received} = true\n  doing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup_now")\n  doing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup_check")\n  doing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup_hold")\n}',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
      'important:zhuli',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '第二天再打开招聘后台时，一条新应聘消息安静地躺在最上面。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '应聘者的简历利落，履历不算夸张，但一看就不是那种只会端茶倒水的花架子。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '备注里只有一句话：“如果岗位是真的，今天方便聊聊。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '第二天收到一份亮眼应聘',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    bgm: '',
    end_script: '// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“高调撒钱”招聘口径，形成后续助理对玩家的第一层预判，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于避免重复调度首份应聘。\n// 计算规则：高调路线会提升招聘关注度，也更容易让应聘者先入为主地觉得玩家像暴发户老板，因此 first_impression 先写为 -1。\n// 写回变量：style=1，attention 增加，first_impression 设为偏负面但可被后续聊天修正；阶段保持为已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 2\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = -1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\nif (!${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\n}',
    id: 'recruit_post_style_high',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '“高薪急招助理，效率第一，待遇不设上限，能立刻到岗最好。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '这话一发出去，像是在招人，也像是在告诉全县——${term.player.self_proud}有钱，而且很急着把摊子铺开。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '招聘口径：高调撒钱',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    bgm: '',
    end_script: '// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“务实正规”招聘口径，让助理后续更容易把玩家视为靠谱雇主，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于避免重复调度首份应聘。\n// 计算规则：务实路线关注度适中，能给应聘者较稳定、较专业的第一感受，因此 first_impression 先写为 1。\n// 写回变量：style=2，attention 小幅增加，first_impression 设为偏正面，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 1\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\nif (!${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\n}',
    id: 'recruit_post_style_regular',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '“招聘助理一名，负责日程、对接、资料整理与事务跟进。薪资面议，流程规范，能长期配合优先。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
